  "result": "Perfect! \u2705 All 297 tests pass (24 new overdue report tests + 273 existing).\n\n**`src/reports.js` \u2014 New reporting module:**\n- `overdueInvoices(invoices, asOf)` \u2014 Filters and reports overdue invoices\n\n**Function behavior:**\n- Filters invoices with status 'issued' or 'partially_paid'\n- Includes only those with `dueDate < asOf` (strictly before)\n- Returns array sorted by `daysOverdue` descending (most overdue first)\n- Each item contains:\n  - `number`: Invoice number\n  - `customerId`: Customer ID\n  - `dueDate`: Original due date\n  - `daysOverdue`: Days past due (calculated via daysBetween)\n  - `due`: Amount still owed (from balanceDue)\n\n**Test coverage (24 new tests):**\n- Empty and no-overdue scenarios\n- Single and multiple overdue invoices\n- Proper date boundary handling (excludes on dueDate, includes day after)\n- Sorting verification (most overdue first)\n- Excludes draft and paid invoices\n- Includes partially_paid invoices\n- Correct daysOverdue and due calculations\n- Multiple terms (NET14, NET30, EOM)\n- Multiple partial payments on same invoice\n- Large invoice lists\n- Field preservation and immutability\n\nFeature complete and ready to ship.",
